{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hit the balls and create combos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Number Crush is an exhilarating puzzle action game where you hit and knock balls with the same number together like billiards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Hit balls with the same number to make them combine into a bigger number!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Add the number of balls that combine to your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Combine many balls in one hit for a combo! Your score will go up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Get more balls if they land in your pocket! A chance to improve your score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Simple controls, just select a ball and hit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Aim for a high score within the stroke limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How big can you make the balls that accelerate and decelerate repeatedly?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839740?t=1754008437","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839740?t=1754008437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839740/22ce53d28ef7433a3d31bc9385d2602b2c1f2f5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754008437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839740/22ce53d28ef7433a3d31bc9385d2602b2c1f2f5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754008437","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hit the balls and create combos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Number Crush is an exhilarating puzzle action game where you hit and knock balls with the same number together like billiards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Hit balls with the same number to make them combine into a bigger number!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Add the number of balls that combine to your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Combine many balls in one hit for a combo! Your score will go up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Get more balls if they land in your pocket! A chance to improve your score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Simple controls, just select a ball and hit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Aim for a high score within the stroke limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How big can you make the balls that accelerate and decelerate repeatedly?</p>","developers":["Amakumo Co., Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839740/25f845e472da42477996e19c1b67fd3e0a62a744/header.jpg?t=1754008437","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257165974,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165974/movie480.mp4?t=1753932158","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165974/movie_max.mp4?t=1753932158"},"name":"NumberCrush","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257165974/8b3f98bdba74d5c21caa53b2b489d525b62189f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753932158","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165974/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753932158","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165974/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753932158"}}],"name":"Number Crush","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 or AMD FX-6300 or better<br></li>